# Environment Configuration for Frontend

## Development

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
VITE_ENVIRONMENT=development
VITE_DEBUG=true
```

## Production

```env
VITE_API_URL=https://api.production.com/api
VITE_ENVIRONMENT=production
VITE_DEBUG=false
```

## Build Optimization Variables

### For .env.production
```env
# API Configuration
VITE_API_URL=/api
VITE_ENVIRONMENT=production

# Logging
VITE_DEBUG=false
VITE_LOG_LEVEL=error

# Performance
VITE_ENABLE_SERVICE_WORKER=true
VITE_PRELOAD_CRITICAL=true

# App Version
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
```

### For .env.development
```env
# API Configuration  
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
VITE_ENVIRONMENT=development

# Logging & Debug
VITE_DEBUG=true
VITE_LOG_LEVEL=debug
VITE_SOURCEMAP=true

# Performance (disabled in dev)
VITE_ENABLE_SERVICE_WORKER=false
VITE_PRELOAD_CRITICAL=false

# App Version
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0-dev
```

## Usage in Code

```typescript
import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL       // API base URL
import.meta.env.VITE_ENVIRONMENT   // 'development' or 'production'
import.meta.env.VITE_DEBUG         // Enable debug logging
import.meta.env.VITE_LOG_LEVEL     // 'debug', 'info', 'error'
import.meta.env.PROD               // Vite built-in: true in production
import.meta.env.DEV                // Vite built-in: true in development
```
